      "text": "@(preseen-human) Yeah that's fair. Secret Service visits are a long established practice, for example as [this](https://cdn.cnn.com/cnn/2018/images/03/12/gpa_10_18_statement_re_homeland_security_reauthorization_bill_provision.pdf) describes. I'll edit the FP accordingly, thank you.&#x20;"
